{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","slug":"Alan's_AutoLogistics","pageid":1559,"revid":21823,"timestamp":"2026-06-09T09:29:02Z","lastEditor":"WhiteEagle17","categories":["Stubs","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"title1","value":"Alan's AutoLogistics"},{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay, Other Area 1"},{"label":"NPC","value":"Alan Burk"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Buying logic items (and auto parts soon)"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.43.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01.11.23"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>This page is a <span data-unresolved=\"1\">stub</span>!</span><br>\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.<br><small><b>Note</b>: Store inventory images are missing, please add those</small></span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n<p><br>\n<b>Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics</b> is a store in Oaklands. Part of the store is closed; the store's owner, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan_Burk/\">Alan Burk</a>. This is the location where players can purchase components and structures with which they can use <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Logic/\">logic</a> on their property including a new <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter/\">truck</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter_Upgrade/\">upgrade</a> for it.\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics appears to be two stores in one. The structure is primarily built out of red brickwork. The neon sign above the store reads \"Alan's Autologistics,\" where the left side for Alan's Auto is written in a varsity font, while the right side for Logistics is written using a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fourteen-segment_display\">fourteen-segment display</a>. While the Logistics side of the store is open for business, the entrance and windows for the Auto side of the store are blacked out to prevent anyone from entering or looking into the store. Curiously, the rear windows are not blacked out. In addition, the lower-left corner of the window is broken, although the reason is unknown. Additionally the Auto side of the store sells the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fever_Vinyl/\">Fever Vinyl</a> and the aforementioned vehicle/upgrade.\n</p><p>Checking behind the cashier's register and looking upwards reveals multiple messages pinned to the upper side of the wall. These messages loosely direct players towards acquiring the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lab_Card/\">Lab Card</a>. This card has Alan's name on it, implying a connection between Alan and the lab.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"cd6e0e16aa4a9087bd5d83af2341d0c8\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Logistics_Store_Interior-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Interior of the Logistics store\">Interior of the Logistics store</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Interior of the Logistics store\">Interior of the Logistics store</span></span></div></div><div>Interior of the Logistics store</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Secret_messages_at_the_Logistics_Store_cashier_room-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Secret messages located above the checkout\">Secret messages located above the checkout</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Secret messages located above the checkout\">Secret messages located above the checkout</span></span></div></div><div>Secret messages located above the checkout</div></div><div><div><div id=\"AutologisticsWindow-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The uncovered window for the Auto side of the store.\">The uncovered window for the Auto side of the store.</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The uncovered window for the Auto side of the store.\">The uncovered window for the Auto side of the store.</span></span></div></div><div>The uncovered window for the Auto side of the store.</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Closed_Alan-s_Auto-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Closed Alan's Auto.png\">Closed Alan's Auto.png</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Closed Alan's Auto.png\">Closed Alan's Auto.png</span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"input\">Input</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Button/\">Button</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: ButtonLogic\">ButtonLogic</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Switch/\">Switch</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Switch boxed\">Switch boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pressure_Pad/\">Pressure Pad</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pressure Pad boxed\">Pressure Pad boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Slider/\">Slider</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span rol