d Lights\">Bulb Powered Lights</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Bulb Powered Lights\">Bulb Powered Lights</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$800\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"other\">Other</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Transmitter/\">Wireless Transmitter</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wireless Transmitter boxed\">Wireless Transmitter boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$1,700\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Receiver/\">Wireless Receiver</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wireless Receiver boxed\">Wireless Receiver boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$1,700\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Memory_Cell/\">Memory Cell</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Memory Cell boxed\">Memory Cell boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$550\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tether/\">Tether</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Tether boxed\">Tether boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$175\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Interactor/\">Interactor</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Interactor boxed\">Interactor boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Collider/\">Collider</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Collider boxed\">Collider boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$840\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Laser/\">Red Laser</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red Laser boxed\">Red Laser boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$1,800\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"Laser Receiver (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFzZXJfUmVjZWl2ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Laser Receiver</span></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Laser Receiver boxed\">Laser Receiver boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$800\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Material_Laser/\">Material Laser</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Material Laser boxed\">Material Laser boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$1,800\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fever_Vinyl/\">Fever Vinyl</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Fever Vinyl\">Fever Vinyl</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$600\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"conveyors\">Conveyors</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/4-Way_Conveyor/\">4-Way Conveyor</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: 4-Way-Conveyor.png\">4-Way-Conveyor.png</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$680\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Filter_Conveyor/\">Filter Conveyor</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Filter Conveyor boxed\">Filter Conveyor boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$280\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alignment_Conveyor/\">Alignment Conveyor</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Alignment Conveyor boxed\">Alignment Conveyor boxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$8500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Extending_Conveyor/\">Extending Conveyor</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>$990\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"misc\">Misc</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Marbles/\">Marble</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: MarbleBoxed.png\">MarbleBoxed.png</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>$150\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>This store existed before for a long time in a dilapidated state, but on November 2023, the building was fixed and the Logistics side of the store was opened for business.</li>\n<li>The signs behind Alan's desk imply that Alan is a girl, however when talked to without purchasing anything, Alan will proclaim that they are the \"go-to guy\" for logistics. Seeing as \"Alen\" is a male name and not unisex, this is likely a mistake on the developer's part.</li>\n<li>The aforementioned signs may be referencing the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Junior_Scientist/\">Junior Scientist</a>, who's not yet a scientist and may be a kid.</li></ul>"}
